# StationAlarm Implementation Plan

This document outlines the approach for updating StationAlarm up to the PRD specifications.

## Proposed Changes

### Data & Architecture
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/data/ActiveStation.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/data/ActiveStation.kt)**:
  - Add `customReminder: String?` and `sendReminder: Boolean`.
  - Update radii getters to generate 5 levels: `alertDistanceKm + 60`, `+ 40`, `+ 30`, `+ 5`, and exactly `alertDistanceKm`.
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/geofence/GeofenceManager.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/geofence/GeofenceManager.kt)**:
  - Modify [addGeofencesForStation](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/geofence/GeofenceManager.kt#38-88) to register 5 distinct geofence levels.
  - Modify [removeGeofencesForStation](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/geofence/GeofenceManager.kt#89-109) to clean up all 5 levels.
  - Log successes and explicit errors on failure.
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/repository/StationRepository.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/repository/StationRepository.kt)**:
  - Update geofence registration/re-registration logic to parse the 5 radii correctly.

### Foreground Tracking Service
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/service/LocationService.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/service/LocationService.kt)**:
  - Update foreground notification to say "Nearest station: [Name] - [X] km".
  - Use `NotificationManager.notify` with `setOnlyAlertOnce(true)` to update silently on every poll.
  - Write `LOCATION_POLL` CSV logs on each update (with battery percent).
  - Re-route the alarm trigger. Instead of playing media in the service, launch a new `AlarmActivity` using a full-screen intent and post a high-priority fallback notification.

### Full-Screen Alarm & UX
- **[NEW] `com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/AlarmActivity.kt`**:
  - Full-screen activity configured with `setShowWhenLocked(true)`, `setTurnScreenOn(true)`, and `window.addFlags(WindowManager.LayoutParams.FLAG_KEEP_SCREEN_ON)`.
  - Compose UI displaying the station name, exact distance, and the optional custom reminder.
  - `MediaPlayer` instantiated here, bound to `AudioManager.STREAM_ALARM`.
  - Overrides `onKeyDown` to catch volume hardware buttons. On press, dismiss the alarm, call `StationRepository.removeActiveStation`, and cancel audio.
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/MainActivity.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/MainActivity.kt)**:
  - Display a black & white Compose modal on first run for background location rationale.
  - Implement a GPS toggle check specifically before adding a station.

### Layouts & UI Re-vamp
- **[DELETE] [com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/SearchScreen.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/SearchScreen.kt)**:
  - Functionality merged into [HomeScreen](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt#34-113).
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt)**:
  - Remove FAB.
  - Insert persistent search bar at the top (with animation).
  - Add zoom out effect and box shadows for [StationCard](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt#114-164) upon click/interaction.
- **[MODIFY] [com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/StationConfigBottomSheet.kt](file:///c:/Users/omama/AndroidStudioProjects/StationAlarm/app/src/main/java/com/omama/stationalarm/ui/screens/StationConfigBottomSheet.kt)**:
  - Add text field for the custom reminder.
  - Add a toggle for the custom reminder.
  - Ensure all styling respects the black & white mandate.

### Analytics & Telemetry
- **[MODIFY] `com/omama/stationalarm/util/Logger.kt`**:
  - Update logging logic to write CSV formatted strings. Includes extracting Battery Percentage when writing `LOCATION_POLL`.
  - Ensure logs are appended to the internal file for easy sharing.

---

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. **Search & Config UI**: Type in the top search bar, verify the bottom sheet opens when a suggestion is clicked. Validate the reminder text config.
2. **Permission Check**: Clean install the app. Verify the background location rationale appears. Deny it, then see the retry prompt. Turn off GPS and try to add a station -> observe the GPS enablement prompt.
3. **Geofencing & Service Start**: Add a station. Trigger a mock geofence enter via Android Studio Emulator Extended Controls. Validate that the service starts and the notification appears showing the nearest station.
4. **Polling Notification Updates**: Use emulator routes to simulate movement. Drag down the notification shade and observe the exact distance string updating WITHOUT chiming or popping up.
5. **Full Screen Alarm**: Arrive at the final radius. Ensure `AlarmActivity` launches over the lock screen, plays sound from the alarm stream, and shows the custom reminder.
6. **Dismissal**: Press the physical Volume Down button on the device/emulator. Ensure audio stops, activity closes, and the notification disappears.
7. **CSVs**: Export logs via the Home Screen share button. Verify the `.csv` format exists and contains polling events.
